Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 14:00:46 +0000
Subject: [M152] [modules] Fix partial SCC linking failure
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Original change's description:
> [modules] Fix partial SCC linking failure
>
> When linking a strongly connected component (SCC) of cyclic
> SourceTextModules in SourceTextModule::MaybeTransitionComponent, run
> RunInitializationCode on all modules in the SCC before transitioning
> any of them to kLinked. Previously, if RunInitializationCode failed on
> a later module in the SCC, earlier modules in the same SCC were already
> marked kLinked and skipped by Module::ResetGraph.
>
> Update GetSharedFunctionInfo, SourceTextModule::Reset, and
> SourceTextModuleVerify to handle modules in kLinking whose code slot
> already holds a JSGeneratorObject (which is observable both during GC
> within the SCC initialization loop and on failure unwind).
>
