+// Flags: --bundle --stack-size=100 --js-defer-import-eval
+
+// cycle-root.mjs and cycle-member.mjs form a cycle, i.e. a single strongly
+// connected component. Linking the component calls
+// SourceTextModule::RunInitializationCode for each of its modules, which calls
+// the module body's generator function just to create the generator object.
+//
+// The body of cycle-root.mjs is a call with 16000 arguments, so the module needs
+// an interpreter register file of ~125KB. That is larger than the entire
+// --stack-size=100 stack, so the stack check at the entry of that call fails
+// unconditionally, and initialization of the component fails halfway through.
+// The only requirement is "arguments * 8 bytes > stack size"; the test does not
+// depend on an exact stack depth.
