+// cycle-member.mjs used to be left behind as LINKED while cycle-root.mjs was
+// reset to UNLINKED, so every later traversal of cycle-member.mjs's exports
+// walked into the half-reset cycle-root.mjs. The four importers below reach it
+// through four different traversals.
